        response: `Nowadays working home is very popular and many people says it is best, but other people want office. This essay discuss both and I think home work is good but not for all.

Firstly, home working save time because worker do not travel every morning. The roads have many traffic and people spend one or two hours. At home they can start fast and also stay with family. For example my friend work in computer company and he is happy because no bus. Also company not need big office and can save money.

On other hand, office is important for communication. When people only use internet, sometimes they not understand the job and internet can be problem. Workers also can become lazy in house because television and family make distraction. In office manager can see them and team can talk directly. This is better for young worker who need learn from experienced people.

In my opinion working home should be normal for computer jobs because it is comfortable and reduce traffic. However factory, hospital and shop cannot do home work. Companies should decide about it and maybe workers go office one or two day. In conclusion both have advantages, but home is more modern and useful for many people.`
